583 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Family-based mental health interventions in Singapore involve collective decision-making and emphasize family cohesion. These interventions include family therapy or educational initiatives designed to improve communication and conflict resolution within the family. Stated by Deputy Prime Minister and Minister for Finance Lawrence Wong during a parliamentary motion on February 7, 2024 - Mental health challenges are increasingly recognized as a public health concern in Singapore. Yet, stigma and cultural barriers prevent individuals from seeking appropriate care. )
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [8]
>>
