974 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1869 0 R
/E (The military was ultimately under the control of civilian leadership, and despite the need for military force, civilian leaders to the best of their efforts combined both military intervention with democratic and diplomatic process. )
/Pg 50 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
975 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1870 0 R
/E (The use of military force was paramount in securing India's territorial integrity and ensuring national security, and illustrate how military intervention, though typically a last resort, was sometimes necessary to ensure the stability of the Indian state. )
/Pg 50 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
