978 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (If the Hyderabad state was not integrated into India, as mentioned earlier, Hyderabad, being a communist state, would have had a different ideology than the Indian one. This meant that if it was not integrated, a great number of resources would need to be expended in order to maintain internal stability within the region, with no guarantee of them working. As such, the military operation that took place to annex Hyderabad was paramount in securing India's territorial integrity and ensuring national security, although it was a last resort. )
/Pg 50 0 R
/K [9]
>>
