/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (The stories of male gods bestowing power and greatness upon male mortals can be seen in tandem with the way society used to function, and still functions today. Their stories were simple and to the point, and were mirrored in the actions taken in ancient Greece. Men and their legacy were the most important thing, compared to the drastic differences and horrors in stories with mortal women. The social tendency revealed is that men in power in the classical period viewed women as toys to handle, with little respect, and therefore allowed them to have full autonomy over womens body and rights. )
/E (The stories of male gods bestowing power and greatness upon male mortals can be seen in tandem with the way society used to function, and still functions today. Their stories were simple and to the point, and were mirrored in the actions taken in ancient Greece. Men and their legacy were the most important thing, compared to the drastic differences and horrors in stories with mortal women. The social tendency revealed is that men in power in the classical period viewed women as toys to handle, with little respect, and therefore allowed them to have full autonomy over womens body and rights. )
/Pg 61 0 R
/K [5]
