/S /P
/E (After threats of persecution and mass migration the Zoroastrian religion is now showing declining population numbers and division within the community for the last few decades. This emerging threat begs the question; What are some of the societal, economic and cultural differences that our prevalent in the modern day as a result of the divide created by the Arab conquest of persia. )
